Do not automatically recenter the export around the visual midpoint.

Do not bake the viewer camera orbit or preview centering transforms into the room asset.

### Scale

Export at:

1 Three.js unit = 1 agreed world unit.

Avoid unexpected scaling.

Avoid negative scales.

Ensure transformations are compatible with normal GLTFLoader import.

### Textures

Embed supported permanent textures into the GLB.

Ensure material references remain intact.

Do not rely on external CDN-hosted images for exported asset appearance.

Avoid unsupported scene-specific procedural shader dependencies.

### Technical implementation

Use a dedicated export scene containing the actual reusable room hierarchy.

Export with binary mode enabled.

Handle errors explicitly.

Trigger a genuine browser download of the ArrayBuffer as a `.glb` file.

Do not show a success message before export completes.

